Bundled PROJJSON definitions of coordinate reference systems
=============================================================

epsg-projjson.tsv.gz contains the PROJJSON definitions of all non-deprecated
coordinate reference systems of the EPSG dataset, one line per CRS
("<EPSG code><TAB><minified PROJJSON>"). It is used to write the "crs" of the
GeoParquet "geo" metadata without network access at runtime.

Source: generated with pyproj (scripts/generate-projjson.py in this bundle) from
the PROJ database, which contains the EPSG dataset. The versions used are recorded
in epsg-projjson.version:

  PROJ    9.8.1   (https://proj.org, MIT licence)
  EPSG    v12.029
  pyproj  3.8.0   (https://pyproj4.github.io/pyproj, MIT licence)

EPSG Geodetic Parameter Dataset
-------------------------------

The definitions are derived from the EPSG Geodetic Parameter Dataset (EPSG
Dataset), which is owned and maintained by the International Association of Oil &
Gas Producers (IOGP). Use of the EPSG Dataset is subject to the EPSG Dataset Terms
of Use: https://epsg.org/terms-of-use.html

The EPSG Dataset is available from https://epsg.org. The data in
epsg-projjson.tsv.gz has been converted to PROJJSON by PROJ; it is not the
original EPSG Dataset and may not reflect its current version.
